message: "If you use unalloc or its case studies, please cite it as below."
title: "unalloc: find the AI spend nobody owns"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Urista
    given-names: Timothy
version: 0.2.1
date-released: "2026-09-14"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/timurista/unalloc"
url: "https://timurista.github.io/unalloc/"
keywords:
  - finops
  - cost attribution
  - opencost
  - llm inference
  - kv cache
  - kubernetes
  - distributed inference
abstract: >-
  unalloc joins OpenCost Kubernetes allocations with LiteLLM, OpenAI and
  Anthropic billing data into one Decimal-exact ledger and reports the share
  of AI spend with no owner. The repository includes five reproducible case
  studies of inference cost attribution, including real PyTorch KV-cache and
  torch.distributed inference.
preferred-citation:
